  Deliberately empty.

  The receivers, the DoseAlarmActivity, the <queries> block and
  USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT are all registered into the APPLICATION manifest by
  plugins/withAlarmReceivers.js, not here. Declaring them in the library manifest
